# Only the synthetic project is committed. Everything else under sample/ is assumed to be a private,
# real TwinCAT project and must never reach the repository.
#
# This file previously carried blanket negations (`!*.TcPOU`, `!*.plcproj`, `!*.compiled-library`, …).
# Those applied to EVERY directory under sample/, so dropping a private project beside the synthetic
# one staged its sources — verified, it really did.
# Keep every negation scoped to TcToolkitSample/ and nothing else.

# Ignore everything...
*

# ...except this file and the synthetic project: generated by scripts/build-sample-project.js, no
# customer or vendor content, safe to publish. It is the ground truth for the diagnostics ratchet —
# correct code, so any diagnostic reported on it is a bug.
!.gitignore
!README.md
!TcToolkitSample/
!TcToolkitSample/**

# VENDOR BINARIES — never committed. TwinCAT copies the referenced Beckhoff libraries into the
# project when it creates one (Tc2_Standard, Tc2_System, Tc3_Module). The .plcproj still REFERENCES
# them, which is what the namespace indexer reads; the archives themselves are Beckhoff's to
# distribute, not ours.
#
# Note this excludes the _Libraries CONTENTS, not the directory itself: git never descends into an
# excluded directory, so a `_Libraries/` rule would make the fisothemes negation below unreachable.
TcToolkitSample/**/_Libraries/*

# ...with ONE exception: TwinCAT Dynamic Collections is MIT-licensed, so it CAN be redistributed.
# Committing it is what lets the library-symbol harnesses actually run on CI and on a fresh clone
# instead of skipping — without it there is no readable archive anywhere in the tree. Provenance and
# attribution are recorded in sample/README.md; keep this negation narrow, one archive only.
!TcToolkitSample/**/_Libraries/fisothemes/
!TcToolkitSample/**/_Libraries/fisothemes/**

# Build artefacts, IDE state and TwinCAT's own backups: large, derived, read by no harness. TwinCAT
# recreates them on build; the extension recreates ST_Files on "Generate ST".
TcToolkitSample/**/_CompileInfo/
TcToolkitSample/**/_CompileInfo_Upload/
TcToolkitSample/**/_Boot/
TcToolkitSample/**/ST_Files/
TcToolkitSample/**/.trust-lsp/
TcToolkitSample/.vs/
TcToolkitSample/**/*.bak
TcToolkitSample/**/*.~u
